# Never upload secrets or build output to Vercel.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory when you deploy from a local machine,
# and .env.local holds the database URL, Google client secret, Gmail app
# password and the session secret. Vercel injects its own copies of these from
# the project settings, so the local file must never travel with a deployment.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
.next
.vercel
*.log
